/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Thank you for your willingness to participate in this study. This survey is intended for caregivers/parents/guardians of children between the ages of birth-17 years of age and adults \(18 years or older\) with classic \(salt-wasting\) congenital adrenal hyperplasia \(CAH\). Your insights are valuable in helping us better understand the diverse perspectives and experiences within the Congenital Adrenal Hyperplasia \(CAH\) community. )
/E (Thank you for your willingness to participate in this study. This survey is intended for caregivers/parents/guardians of children between the ages of birth-17 years of age and adults \(18 years or older\) with classic \(salt-wasting\) congenital adrenal hyperplasia \(CAH\). Your insights are valuable in helping us better understand the diverse perspectives and experiences within the Congenital Adrenal Hyperplasia \(CAH\) community. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (This survey is designed to explore health-related and quality of life information; differences between U.S. and international participants; and patient experiences with adrenal crisis events and CAH treatment/ management. Please answer the questions to the best of your knowledge and remember that the answers to this survey are confidential. )
/E (This survey is designed to explore health-related and quality of life information; differences between U.S. and international participants; and patient experiences with adrenal crisis events and CAH treatment/ management. Please answer the questions to the best of your knowledge and remember that the answers to this survey are confidential. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
